  "readmeFile": "Package.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Closed out most of the remaining Slack Web API coverage gaps: calls.*, dnd.*, stars.*, reminders.*, files.remote.*, search.files/search.all, workflows.stepCompleted/stepFailed/updateStep, functions.completeSuccess/completeError, apps.manifest.create/delete/export/update/validate, apps.uninstall, apps.event.authorizations.list, chat.meMessage, users.setPhoto, auth.teams.list, migration.exchange, and the Slack Connect shared-invite methods on conversations.* (inviteShared, acceptSharedInvite, approveSharedInvite, declineSharedInvite, listConnectInvites, externalInvitePermissions.set, requestSharedInvite.approve/deny/list). Updated dependency on Universal.Slack 1.7.0.0 for the new backing models.",
